From 393d9b7b8064669559aaf1fa8d676c8eebc9e68a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mechres <164776284+Mechres@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 07:04:17 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 01/11] Build out of tree against Linux 7.2 as a non-DRM
 /dev/pvrsrvkm module

Kbuild with the stock Allwinner 1.12 option set (SGX_BUILD_OPTIONS 0x1036a41c),
compat headers, kernel API updates (access_ok, mmap_lock, get_user_pages, timers,
p4d, proc_ops, vm_flags_set, vmf_insert_mixed, class_create, void remove, dma_sync),
and this tree's omap system layer as the starting point for the sunxi one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
